    source:{ name:"OpenAI", handle:"OpenAI", platform:"web", kind:"lab" },
    text:"OpenAI confirmed DevDay 2026 for September 29 in San Francisco and is previewing 'Managed Agents' -- letting developers build and run persistent Agents, Environments, and Agent Sessions directly on the OpenAI Platform rather than hosting the orchestration layer themselves.",
