    text:"Baidu's Xiaodu unit unveiled a refreshed smart-display, camera, companion-screen and speaker lineup at a Beijing event, all running the upgraded Chaoneng ('Super') Xiaodu agent -- and extended the same free upgrade to tens of millions of already-sold Xiaodu devices rather than confining it to new hardware.",
