    text:"Clay closed a $115 million round led by Wellington Management at a $7.1 billion valuation, the AI sales-and-marketing automation startup's fourth valuation jump in under two years -- up from the roughly $7 billion pre-money figure Axios reported August 31, a $5 billion employee tender in January, and a $3.1 billion Series C last August.",
